  "description": "DIGPOA crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H58 Eu4 N36 O5,13(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 3 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 3 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 3 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.729-5.338 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.07-177.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [(L1-2H)2(L1-H)2Eu4(O)(N3)4](H2O)13. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 13 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
